EXPANSION RULE (makes 10,000 tasks)
We will generate tasks by Cartesian product with a cap:
1) Use the 250 templates below (K=250).
2) For each template, generate N=40 concrete instances by varying:
   - localeVariant ∈ {ro, en, de, es, pt} (5)
   - deviceVariant ∈ {mobile, desktop} (2)
   - scenarioVariant ∈ {new_user, returning_user, slow_3g, low_end_cpu} (4)
   - Pick only one combination per instance (5*2*4 = 40).
3) Total = 250 * 40 = 10,000 tasks.

